                                "sense_id": "2f341161-e357-3689-84a7-bbdf68138e78",
                                "text": "FOIA is what enables regular people to pester powerful federal agencies into handing over information about what they’ve been up to. FOIA’s website calls it “the law that keeps citizens in the know about their government.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2eeff14f-7d24-4c13-a68e-f8a035acb5f6",
                                "sense_id": "2f341161-e357-3689-84a7-bbdf68138e78",
                                "text": "The watchdog group behind the FOIA litigation has taken up Cooper’s invitation for discovery, seeking depositions of Gleason and of Steve Davis, a longtime Musk adviser now involved with DOGE, as well as other internal information about its work."
                            }
